# Search Console & Analytics (Phase 1 + Phase 2)

Phased work and action IDs live in [docs/plans/search-and-analytics.md](docs/plans/search-and-analytics.md) (`SEARCH-*`). Casting content strategy stays in `DISC-*` / [casting-discoverability.md](docs/plans/casting-discoverability.md).

## Phase 1 — GA4 (measurement)

- Load GA only on **public** pages. Skip `/studio` and any page with `noIndex` (`shouldLoadGa` in `src/lib/analytics.ts`).
- App Insights remains Studio/ops telemetry — do not send Studio diagnostics to GA.
- Keep the event set small: `generate_lead`, `file_download`, `select_content` via `trackGaEvent` / `data-ga-*`.
- Consent Mode banner is `SEARCH-P1-006` `wont_fix` unless product/legal reopens it.
- Ops residuals (not code): `SEARCH-P1-005` measurement-only Admin checklist; DebugView verify for events.

## Phase 2 — Technical SEO

- **Titles:** Pages pass bare titles. `BaseLayout` appends ` · Elyse Tindall` (and strips legacy `| Elyse Tindall`). Do not embed the brand in casting frontmatter — see [add-casting-page.md](docs/runbooks/add-casting-page.md).
- **JSON-LD:** `Seo.astro` prepends default `Person` when custom `jsonLd` has no top-level / `@graph` Person. Nested `about` / `founder` do not count. Do not emit duplicate conflicting Person `@id`s.
- **Canonicals / schema URLs:** Prefer slashless paths (e.g. `/materials`, not `/materials/`).
- **Studio:** `noIndex` on `/studio`; sitemap filters `/studio`; `Disallow: /studio` in `public/robots.txt`.
- **OG default:** `public/images/og-default.jpg` is 1200×630 JPEG; default path emits `og:image:width` / `height` / `alt`.
- **Tests:** `J-SEO-01` in `tests/journeys/seo.spec.ts`; smoke asserts robots Disallow.

## Keep docs in sync

When you change the surfaces in this rule’s globs (or GA events / SEO contracts), update in the **same PR**:

| Change | Update |
|--------|--------|
| GA loader, skip rules, or events | `search-and-analytics.md` Phase 1 ACs + [observability.md](docs/runbooks/observability.md) |
| Title suffix / casting title contract | Plan Phase 2 + `AGENTS.md` SEO section + `add-casting-page.md` |
| Person JSON-LD merge or page schemas | Plan Phase 2 + `docs/style-guide.md` SEO notes |
| robots.txt / OG default / slashless URLs | Plan Phase 2 statuses/ACs |
| SEO journey/smoke coverage | Plan `SEARCH-P2-007` + `ux-release-testing-strategy.md` (`J-SEO-01`) |

Prefer linking the plan from PR bodies over pasting the full backlog.
